# PocketBase (site backend)

PocketBase backs `@stream-kit/site` only. All backend code lives under `site/` — never in `packages/app` or plugin packages.

## Layout

| Path | Purpose |
| --- | --- |
| `site/pb/pb_migrations/` | Schema migrations (committed) |
| `site/pb/pb_hooks/` | JS hooks (committed) |
| `site/pb/pb_data/` | Local DB + uploads (gitignored) |
| `site/pb/pocketbase(.exe)` | Downloaded binary (gitignored) |
| `site/scripts/setup-pocketbase.mjs` | Downloads binary (`POCKETBASE_VERSION`) |
| `site/scripts/run-pocketbase.mjs` | Serves on `http://127.0.0.1:8090` |
| `site/scripts/seed-plugins.mjs` | Seeds plugins + uploads release zips to `files` |

Dev: `pnpm --filter @stream-kit/site dev` (PocketBase + SvelteKit). Admin UI: `http://127.0.0.1:8090/_/`.

## Schema changes

- **Always** add a migration in `site/pb/pb_migrations/` — do not hand-edit `pb_data`.
- Start migrations with `/// <reference path="../pb_data/types.d.ts" />`.
- Use the `migrate(up, down)` pattern; keep collection IDs stable when editing existing migrations.
- Field names: **camelCase** (`streamKitVersion`, `isLatest`, `publishedAt`, `mimeType`).
- Document collection/field changes in `docs/site.md`.

### Collections

- **`plugins`** — stable identity: `key` (unique), `name` (unique), `description`, `icon`, `author` → `_pb_users_auth_`.
- **`files`** — release zips: `file` (upload), `mimeType`, `size`, `sha256`, `originalName` (metadata filled by `files.pb.js` hook).
- **`plugin_versions`** — releases linked to `plugins` (cascade delete): `version`, `streamKitVersion`, `entry`, `file` → `files`, `changelog`, `isLatest`, `publishedAt`. Unique on `(plugin, version)`.

## SvelteKit integration

- Talk to PocketBase **server-side only** via `site/src/lib/server/services/` (e.g. `PluginsService`).
- Wire services through `event.locals.services` in `site/src/lib/server/hooks/services.ts`.
- Default URL: `http://127.0.0.1:8090`. Do not expose admin tokens or superuser credentials to the client.
- Prefer `neverthrow` for service-layer error handling.
- Build file download URLs with `site/src/lib/server/pocketbase/file-url.ts`.

```typescript
// ✅ Server load / action
export const load = async ({ locals }) => {
	const result = await locals.services.plugins().listLatest();
	// ...
};

// ❌ Never import PocketBase admin client from +page.svelte or client code
```

## Hooks

Place hook scripts in `site/pb/pb_hooks/`. Keep hooks focused; use migrations for schema, hooks for request/record lifecycle logic.

- **`files.pb.js`** — on create/update of `files`, sets `mimeType`, `size`, `sha256`, and `originalName` from the uploaded file.

## Version bumps

When upgrading PocketBase, update `POCKETBASE_VERSION` in `site/scripts/setup-pocketbase.mjs`, delete the old binary, and re-run `pnpm --filter @stream-kit/site pb:setup`.
